    "identifier": "dragonfly-landing",
    "description": "<p>Your jump up and then stab down with numerous thrusts. Make a melee taijutsu Attack against a target creature in range. On a hit you deal your [Weapon damage] +2d10.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: On a hit, affected creature must make a Strength saving throw, being knocked Prone on a failed save. You also land in their space. If they would attempt to stand while still sharing a space, you get an attack of opportunity.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and damage by 1d10.</p>",
